  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nP(A) = (3)/(8)\n\nP(B) = (1)/(2)\n\nP(A ∩ B) = (1)/(4)\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nP(A̅ ∩ B̅) = 1 - P(A ∪ B)\n\nP(A ∪ B) = P(A) + P(B) - P(A ∩ B)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nP(A ∪ B) = (3)/(8) + (1)/(2) - (1)/(4)\n\n⇒ P(A ∪ B) = (3)/(8) + (4)/(8) - (2)/(8)\n\n⇒ P(A ∪ B) = (5)/(8)\n\n⇒ P(A̅ ∩ B̅) = 1 - (5)/(8)\n\n⇒ P(A̅ ∩ B̅) = (3)/(8)\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (2).**",
